/**
 * PREVIEW-ONLY sample data for the net-new VPS main-landing DIRECTION
 * (components/marketing/vpstemplate/*). Nothing here touches the live VPS pages,
 * PricingExplorer, VpsConfigurator, or any shipped route — it exists purely so
 * the /preview/vps route renders with realistic, on-brand content.
