          </h2>
          <p className="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-400">
            Flat per-mailbox pricing on your own infrastructure — no annual per-seat lock-in, no ecosystem you have to
            live inside.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div className="mt-12">
          <PriceCompare />
        </div>
        <p className="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center text-xs text-slate-600">
          Competitor figures are approximate published list prices, shown for comparison only.
        </p>
